          "en": "1. Where the registered investment capital is increased or reduced, the owner of the sole proprietorship must send the application for registration of change of investment capital to the provincial-level business registration office of the locality where the enterprise has its head office.\n2. After receiving the enterprise registration dossier, the provincial-level business registration office shall hand the dossier receipt slip and the appointment for return of results to the dossier submitter. Within 01 working day from the date of receipt of the enterprise registration dossier, the provincial-level business registration office shall consider the validity of the dossier and grant the enterprise registration certificate to the enterprise in accordance with regulations; where the dossier is not yet valid, the provincial-level business registration office shall notify the enterprise in writing of the contents requiring amendment or supplementation."
