          "en": "1. Data standardisation means the carrying out of the steps of reviewing, checking, comparing and supplementing and updating enterprise registration information and the legal status of enterprises in respect of enterprises already stored in the national database on enterprise registration.\n2. On the basis of the enterprise registration information stored in the national database on enterprise registration within the locality under its management, the provincial-level business registration office shall send a notice on the review of enterprise registration information and the legal status of the enterprise to the enterprise, requiring the enterprise to compare, supplement and update the information.\nWhere the enterprise registration information and the legal status of the enterprise in the national database on enterprise registration are missing or not yet accurate compared with the enterprise registration certificate or the paper enterprise registration dossier, the enterprise shall send a notice supplementing and updating the information to the provincial-level business registration office in accordance with clause 1 Article 57 of this Decree within 90 days from the date on which the provincial-level business registration office sends the notice. The enterprise shall be responsible for the truthfulness and accuracy of the information notified to the provincial-level business registration office.\n3. For data of enterprises converted into the national database on enterprise registration where the enterprise registration dossiers have not yet been digitised, the provincial-level business registration office shall be responsible for digitising and naming the electronic documents corresponding to the names of the types of documents in the enterprise registration dossiers and for storing the enterprise registration dossiers in full in the national database on enterprise registration.\n4. The implementation of the digitisation of dossiers and the standardisation of data, and the updating and supplementation of enterprise registration information, shall be carried out in accordance with the plan of the provincial-level business registration office."
