          "en": "1. Any person who stores or transports goods which the State prohibits from being traded, circulated or used, or which are not yet permitted to be circulated or used in Vietnam, in one of the following cases, if not falling within the cases provided for in Articles 249, 250, 253, 254, 304, 305, 306, 309 and 311 of this Code, shall be sentenced to a fine of from VND 50,000,000 to VND 300,000,000 or to imprisonment for from 06 months to 03 years:\na) The unlawful goods are chemicals, antibiotics, veterinary medicines or plant protection products prohibited from use in cultivation, livestock raising, aquaculture, salt production, preliminary processing, processing or preservation of agricultural, forestry and aquatic products and salt;\nb) The unlawful goods are valued at from VND 100,000,000 to under VND 300,000,000;\nc) Unlawfully gaining from VND 50,000,000 to under VND 200,000,000;\nd) The unlawful goods are valued at under VND 100,000,000 or the unlawful gain is under VND 50,000,000 but the person has already been subject to an administrative penalty for the act provided for in this Article or in one of Articles 188, 189, 190, 192, 193, 194, 195, 196 and 200 of this Code or has already been convicted of one of these crimes, whose criminal record has not been expunged, and still commits it;\ne) Transporting prohibited goods across the border or from a non-tariff zone into the inland area and in the reverse direction, valued at from VND 50,000,000 to under VND 100,000,000, with an unlawful gain of from VND 20,000,000 to under VND 50,000,000.\n2. Committing the crime in one of the following cases, the person shall be sentenced to a fine of from VND 300,000,000 to VND 1,000,000,000 or to imprisonment for from 02 years to 05 years:\na) In an organised manner;\nb) Taking advantage of position or power;\nc) Taking advantage of the name of an agency or organisation;\nd) On a professional basis;\ne) The unlawful goods are valued at from VND 300,000,000 to under VND 500,000,000;\nf) Unlawfully gaining from VND 200,000,000 to under VND 500,000,000;\ng) Committing the crime in one of the cases provided for in points a, b, c and d clause 1 of this Article across the border or from a non-tariff zone into the inland area and in the reverse direction;\nh) Dangerous recidivism.\n3. Committing the crime in one of the following cases, the person shall be sentenced to imprisonment for from 05 years to 10 years:\na) The unlawful goods are valued at VND 500,000,000 or more;\nb) Unlawfully gaining VND 500,000,000 or more;\nc) Committing the crime in one of the cases provided for in points a, b, c, d, e, f and h clause 2 of this Article across the border or from a non-tariff zone into the inland area and in the reverse direction.\n4. The offender may also be sentenced to a fine of from VND 10,000,000 to VND 50,000,000, to prohibition from holding office, from practising a profession or from doing certain jobs for from 01 year to 05 years.\n5. A commercial legal entity that commits the crime provided for in this Article shall be punished as follows:\na) A commercial legal entity that commits the crime in the case provided for in clause 1 of this Article shall be sentenced to a fine of from VND 300,000,000 to VND 1,000,000,000;\nb) Committing the crime in the case provided for in clause 2 of this Article, it shall be sentenced to a fine of from VND 1,000,000,000 to VND 3,000,000,000;\nc) Committing the crime in the case provided for in clause 3 of this Article, it shall be sentenced to a fine of from VND 3,000,000,000 to VND 5,000,000,000 or to suspension of operations for a definite term of from 06 months to 03 years;\nd) Committing the crime in the case provided for in Article 79 of this Code, it shall be subject to permanent suspension of operations;\ne) The commercial legal entity may also be sentenced to a fine of from VND 50,000,000 to VND 200,000,000, to prohibition of business or of operation in certain fields, or to prohibition of capital mobilisation for from 01 year to 03 years."
