          "en": "Collection and payment to the State budget\n1. Any person who is responsible for preserving and managing invoices and documents but violates the State's regulations on the preservation and management of invoices and documents for collection and payment to the State budget, causing damage to the State budget or to other persons of from VND 100,000,000 to under VND 500,000,000, shall be fined from VND 10,000,000 to VND 100,000,000 or subject to non-custodial reform for up to 03 years.\n2. Committing the offence in any of the following cases shall be subject to a fine of from VND 100,000,000 to VND 500,000,000 or imprisonment from 06 months to 03 years:\na) The offence is committed 02 or more times;\nb) Causing damage of VND 500,000,000 or more.\n3. The offender may also be prohibited from holding office or doing certain jobs for 01 to 05 years."
